e input field, you would notice a delay in highlighting the query inside th=
e list.</p>
<p>React has separated the rendering of the urgent task (updating the input=
 field when the user types) from the non-urgent task (highlighting the quer=
y inside the list). Such an approach provides a better user experience.</p>
<h2 id=3D"4-conclusion" style=3D"position:relative"><a href=3D"https://dmit=
