a>4. Conclusion</h2>
<p>The concurrent mode in React lets you separate urgent from non-urgent ta=
sks, making the UI updates more user-friendly.</p>
<p>After <a href=3D"https://github.com/reactwg/react-18/discussions/5" targ=
